      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Standup Timer</title>\n  <style>\n    [hidden] {\n      display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    :root {\n      --bg-color: #1a1c23;\n      --card-bg: #2d313f;\n      --border-color: #000000;\n      --text-main: #f0f3f6;\n      --accent-color: #ffcc00;\n      --accent-active: #38bdf8;\n      --button-bg: #4f46e5;\n      --button-hover: #4338ca;\n      --button-active: #3730a3;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      background-color: var(--bg-color);\n      background-image: \n        linear-gradient(45deg, #161820 25%, transparent 25%),\n        linear-gradient(-45deg, #161820 25%, transparent 25%),\n        linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 75%, #161820 75%),\n        linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 75%, #161820 75%);\n      background-size: 32px 32px;\n      background-position: 0 0, 0 16px, 16px -16px, -16px 0px;\n      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace, monospace;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .timer-card {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 440px;\n      background: var(--card-bg);\n      border: 4px solid var(--border-color);\n      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px var(--border-color);\n      padding: 24px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n      color: var(--accent-color);\n      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--border-color);\n    }\n\n    .roster {\n      list-style: none;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n    }\n\n    .roster-item {\n      padding: 10px 14px;\n      background: #202430;\n      border: 2px solid var(--border-color);\n      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--border-color);\n      font-weight: bold;\n      text-align: left;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      transition: background 0.1s ease;\n    }\n\n    .roster-item.active {\n      background: var(--accent-active);\n      color: #0f172a;\n      border-color: #000000;\n      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--border-color);\n      transform: translate(-2px, -2px);\n    }\n\n    .roster-item.completed {\n      opacity: 0.5;\n      text-decoration: line-through;\n    }\n\n    .badge {\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n\n    .timer-display {\n      font-size: 3rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      padding: 16px;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n      background: #11141c;\n      color: var(--accent-color);\n      border: 4px solid var(--border-color);\n      box-shadow: inset 4px 4px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .standup-over-message {\n      font-size: 1.75rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: var(--accent-color);\n      padding: 24px 16px;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n      background: #11141c;\n      border: 4px solid var(--border-color);\n      box-shadow: inset 4px 4px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .controls {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 12px;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .pixel-btn {\n      flex: 1;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      padding: 12px 16px;\n      background-color: var(--button-bg);\n      color: #ffffff;\n      border: 3px solid var(--border-color);\n      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--border-color);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n\n    .pixel-btn:hover {\n      background-color: var(--button-hover);\n    }\n\n    .pixel-btn:focus-visible {\n      outline: 3px dashed var(--accent-color);\n      outline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .pixel-btn:active {\n      transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--border-color);\n      background-color: var(--button-active);\n    }\n\n    .pixel-btn:disabled {\n      background-color: #4b5563;\n      color: #9ca3af;\n      cursor: not-allowed;\n      transform: none;\n      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--border-color);\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"timer-card\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Pixel Standup Timer\">\n    <h1>Standup Timer</h1>\n\n    <ul class=\"roster\" id=\"roster-list\" aria-label=\"Participants\">\n      <!-- Roster rendered dynamically -->\n    </ul>\n\n    <div id=\"timer\" class=\"timer-display\" role=\"timer\" aria-live=\"polite\">1:30</div>\n    <div id=\"over-msg\" class=\"standup-over-message\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" hidden>Standup over</div>\n\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"btn-next\" class=\"pixel-btn\" aria-label=\"Next person\">Next</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"btn-reset\" class=\"pixel-btn\" aria-label=\"Reset standup\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    const DURATION = 90;\n    const NAMES = [\"Alice\", \"Bob\", \"Charlie\", \"Diana\"];\n\n    let currentIndex = 0;\n    let remainingSeconds = DURATION;\n    let timerInterval = null;\n\n    const rosterEl = document.getElementById(\"roster-list\");\n    const timerEl = document.getElementById(\"timer\");\n    const overMsgEl = document.getElementById(\"over-msg\");\n    const nextBtn = document.getElementById(\"btn-next\");\n    const resetBtn = document.getElementById(\"btn-reset\");\n\n    function formatTime(seconds) {\n      const m = Math.floor(seconds / 60);\n      const s = seconds % 60;\n      return `${m}:${s < 10 ? '0' : ''}${s}`;\n    }\n\n    function renderRoster() {\n      rosterEl.innerHTML = \"\";\n      NAMES.forEach((name, idx) => {\n        const li = document.createElement(\"li\");\n        li.className = \"roster-item\";\n        \n        const isDone = currentIndex >= NAMES.length || idx < currentIndex;\n        const isActive = idx === currentIndex && currentIndex < NAMES.length;\n\n        if (isActive) {\n          li.classList.add(\"active\");\n          li.setAttribute(\"aria-current\", \"true\");\n        } else if (isDone && currentIndex > idx) {\n          li.classList.add(\"completed\");\n        }\n\n        const nameSpan = document.createElement(\"span\");\n        nameSpan.textContent = `${idx + 1}. ${name}`;\n        li.appendChild(nameSpan);\n\n        if (isActive) {\n          const badge = document.createElement(\"span\");\n          badge.className = \"badge\";\n          badge.textContent = \"Speaking\";\n          li.appendChild(badge);\n        } else if (isDone && currentIndex > idx) {\n          const badge = document.createElement(\"span\");\n          badge.className = \"badge\";\n          badge.textContent = \"Done\";\n          li.appendChild(badge);\n        }\n\n        rosterEl.appendChild(li);\n      });\n    }\n\n    function updateDisplay() {\n      if (currentIndex >= NAMES.length) {\n        clearInterval(timerInterval);\n        timerInterval = null;\n        timerEl.hidden = true;\n        overMsgEl.hidden = false;\n        nextBtn.disabled = true;\n      } else {\n        timerEl.hidden = false;\n        overMsgEl.hidden = true;\n        timerEl.textContent = formatTime(remainingSeconds);\n        nextBtn.disabled = false;\n      }\n      renderRoster();\n    }\n\n    function nextPerson() {\n      currentIndex++;\n      remainingSeconds = DURATION;\n      updateDisplay();\n    }\n\n    function tick() {\n      if (remainingSeconds > 0) {\n        remainingSeconds--;\n        timerEl.textContent = formatTime(remainingSeconds);\n      } else {\n        nextPerson();\n      }\n    }\n\n    function startTimer() {\n      if (timerInterval) clearInterval(timerInterval);\n      timerInterval = setInterval(tick, 1000);\n    }\n\n    function resetStandup() {\n      currentIndex = 0;\n      remainingSeconds = DURATION;\n      updateDisplay();\n      startTimer();\n    }\n\n    nextBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      if (currentIndex < NAMES.length) {\n        nextPerson();\n      }\n    });\n\n    resetBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      resetStandup();\n    });\n\n    // Initial setup\n    updateDisplay();\n    startTimer();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML file containing the markup, pixelated CSS theme, and plain JavaScript logic for the Standup Timer."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Standup Timer\n\nA retro pixel-themed standup timer built with pure HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript. Runs completely offline with zero external dependencies, network requests, or build steps.\n\n## Features\n\n- **4 Built-in Attendees**: Pre-configured roster of 4 participants (Alice, Bob, Charlie, Diana).\n- **90-Second Countdown**: Each participant gets 90 seconds, formatted strictly as `m:ss`.\n- **Early Skip**: A \"Next\" button to immediately advance to the next attendee.\n- **Highlighting**: Clear highlight badge and styled active state for the current speaker.\n- **Completion Screen**: Displays \"Standup over\" once all participants have finished.\n- **Accessible & Responsive**: Fully keyboard accessible with custom focus states, responsive layout fitting displays down to 360px wide.\n\n## How to Run\n\n1. Open `index.html` directly in any modern browser.\n2. No local server, packages, or build tools are required.",
      "description": "Documentation for the Pixel Standup Timer application including features and usage instructions."
    }
